OL,3,GNEWSAShoemakers showcase skills with
OL,4,Anew global festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new festival celebrating the craft of
OL,7,Fmaking shoes will attract visitors from
OL,8,Faround the world, organisers hope.
OL,10,FShoetown will be "a landmark
OL,11,Fcelebration of Northampton's
OL,12,Finternationally renowned shoemaking
OL,13,Fheritage," said West Northamptonshire
OL,14,FCouncil, which is supporting the
OL,15,Finitiative.
OL,17,FOne of the town's shoemakers, Crown
OL,18,FNorthampton, was partly inspired by
OL,19,Fsimilar footwear events in New York and
OL,20,FChicago.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
