OL,3,GNEWSAShoemakers showcase skills with
OL,4,Anew global festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts owner Chris Woodford said:
OL,7,F"Shoemaking is in my bones, and almost
OL,8,Feveryone in Northamptonshire knows
OL,9,Fsomeone who has worked in the trade or
OL,10,Fbeen involved with it."
